# Latest Models Only (Jan 2026) + Setup Sanity Checks

This rule is a hard allowlist. If you see older/legacy model IDs in code, replace them with the latest allowlisted IDs below.

## Hard rules (do not break)
- Use ONLY the model IDs listed in this file.
- Prefer Vercel AI Gateway routing via the AI SDK (do not wire provider SDKs directly unless explicitly required).
- If the codebase references older model families (GPT-4.x, Claude 3.x, Gemini 1.x/2.x, etc.), upgrade to the allowlist.
- If a model is missing from Vercel AI Gateway, do not invent slugs. Use only what Vercel exposes, or add via Vercel if supported.

